          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable='true' spellcheck='false' style='font-family:sans-serif; border-bottom:3px solid #2e1065; padding-bottom:16px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='font-size:32px; font-weight:900; color:#2e1065; letter-spacing:1.5px; line-height:1.1;'>ELENA ROSTOVA</div><div style='font-size:12.5px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:2.5px; color:#f472b6; margin-top:8px; background:#2e1065; display:inline-block; padding:5px 12px; border-radius:4px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'>SENIOR BRAND & INTERACTIVE ART DIRECTOR</div></div>",
          "transform": "none",
          "zIndex": 4,
          "scaleX": "1",
          "scaleY": "1"
        },
        {
          "left": "295.0px",
          "top": "205.0px",
          "width": "465.0px",
          "height": "115.0px",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable='true' spellcheck='false' style='font-family:sans-serif; background:#f8fafc; border-left:4px solid #2e1065; padding:14px 18px; border-radius:0 6px 6px 0; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='font-size:11px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:2px; color:#2e1065; margin-bottom:6px;'>EXECUTIVE PROFILE</div><div style='font-size:12px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55;'>Results-driven leader with 9+ years of specialized experience delivering high-impact initiatives, mentoring top-performing teams, and driving measurable operational excellence across fast-paced environments.</div></div>",
          "transform": "none",
          "zIndex": 5,
          "scaleX": "1",
          "scaleY": "1"
        },
        {
          "left": "295.0px",
          "top": "342.0px",
          "width": "465.0px",
          "height": "530.0px",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable='true' spellcheck='false' style='font-family:sans-serif;'><div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:2.5px; color:#2e1065; border-bottom:2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom:6px; margin-bottom:18px;'>PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE</div><div style='margin-bottom:20px; border-left:3px solid #f472b6; padding-left:14px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;'><span style='font-size:14px; font-weight:900; color:#0f172a;'>Associate Design Director — Pentagram Partner Studio</span><span style='font-size:10.5px; font-weight:800; color:#2e1065; background:#f1f5f9; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:4px;'>2022 - PRESENT</span></div><div style='font-size:12.2px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55; margin-top:6px;'>Led global visual rebrands for 14 cultural institutions and Fortune 500 consumer tech brands, winning 3 Cannes Lions.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px; border-left:3px solid #f472b6; padding-left:14px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;'><span style='font-size:14px; font-weight:900; color:#0f172a;'>Senior Brand Designer — Collins NY</span><span style='font-size:10.5px; font-weight:800; color:#2e1065; background:#f1f5f9; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:4px;'>2019 - 2022</span></div><div style='font-size:12.2px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55; margin-top:6px;'>Created kinetic typography systems, packaging architecture, and interactive web flagships increasing conversion by 62%.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px; border-left:3px solid #f472b6; padding-left:14px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;'><span style='font-size:14px; font-weight:900; color:#0f172a;'>Visual Designer — Spotify In-House Creative</span><span style='font-size:10.5px; font-weight:800; color:#2e1065; background:#f1f5f9; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:4px;'>2017 - 2019</span></div><div style='font-size:12.2px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55; margin-top:6px;'>Designed global out-of-home campaign visuals and Wrapped interactive social experiences for 200M+ listeners.</div></div></div>",
          "transform": "none",
